OL,3,GNEWSACall for extra CCTV after park
OL,4,Avandalism 'spree'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are calls for increased CCTV in
OL,7,FGrantham's parks after a skatepark was
OL,8,Fvandalised just months after it was
OL,9,Fopened.
OL,11,FCouncillor Matthew Bailey told a
OL,12,Fmeeting there had been a "spree" of
OL,13,Fvandalism in the town's parks adding
OL,14,Fthat inappropriate graffiti had been
OL,15,Fsprayed on the skating facility in
OL,16,FWyndham Park which opened at Christmas.
OL,18,FKaren Whitfield, assistant director for
OL,19,Fleisure, culture and place at South
OL,20,FKesteven District Council, said funding
OL,21,Fhad been approved for additional CCTV
OL,22,Fcameras to cover the skatepark.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
